oneOf.description:
RFC 7911 ADD-PATH for this group's unicast families (`ipv4`/`ipv6`;
never EVPN). `None` is `Both` for a `route_server_client` group and off
otherwise. Carried in the OPEN, so a change restarts the sessions.

lacp_mode.description:
This link's LACP Activity (`Passive` = never speaks first). Only
meaningful while `port_aggregate` names a `Lacp`-mode aggregate;
ignored (not rejected) otherwise.

StpMode.description:
Which protocol the bridge runs. `Rstp` is the default (one tree);
`Mstp` maps VLANs to `mst-instances`; `RapidPvst` runs one RSTP tree per
VLAN of a `BroadcastDomain`; `Disabled` turns spanning tree off.

